# Documentation. Every file under docs/ is TRACKED by default (W13, 2026-10-10): the
# old blanket `docs/*` rule silently untracked every new private doc whose author
# forgot `git add -f`. What ships publicly is decided by scripts/public_manifest.txt +
# scripts/private_paths.txt, not by this file. Ignore only genuinely local output
# (this file ships, so it names no private tree — the scrub gate greps for them):
docs/design/040/_*.json
docs/design/040/marketing/exports/
docs/design/070/refs/
docs/design/070/shots/
/docs/**/*.json
/docs/**/.alloc.lock

